<title>USA: Boeing delivers 54 jets in Q3.</title>
<headline>Boeing delivers 54 jets in Q3.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Boeing Co said on Friday it delivered 54 commercial jet airplanes in the third quarter ended September 30, including 15 737s, 5 747s, 15 757s, 10 767s and 9 777s.</p>
<p>Total commercial jet transport deliveries for the first nine months of 1996 were 156, consisting of 53 737s, 16 747s, 34 757s, 29 767s and 24 777s.</p>
<p>The company continues to project total 1996 deliveries to be about 215 airplanes.</p>
</text>
